Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:16:13 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] J714s developer image: merged kernel, loader 0002-0004, new
 developer signer

The fork that held the old development key and boot recipes is gone.
Packages linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora16.j714s3-1 (merged linux-aurora +
linux-aurora-n1 series, DM_INTEGRITY), m1n1-aurora 1.6.1.aurora22.j714s3-1
and omarchy-aurora-firmware 20261014.j714s2-1 come from
betizzel/omarchy-m5 installer/recipes (da026119060a); the other boot
packages keep their bytes and now name that repo as their source.
Developer signer 0DA040FF52D5EC6FB6538769DBFEBBB2B6D116B1 replaces
5C2445B5C37B584B5FC75D8711DFC2D674A06D68. The kernel command line also
seeds the arguments the merged kernel was verified with (PMGR read-only
allow list, pd/clk_ignore_unused, idle=nop, arm64.nowfxt, NVMe flush).
finish-inputs takes this clean checkout's HEAD as the builder commit.
